  "sourceTitle": "Cheese Dip",
  "sourceText": "Cheese Dip\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, January 1, 2010 - 1:13am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 pounds Velveeta cheese\n2 cans Rotel tomatoes and chilies\n1 can mushroom soup\n1 small jar Pace picante sauce\n1 teaspoon garlic powder\nDash of Worcestershire\n1 medium onion\n1 pound sausage\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all of the liquids and cheese together in a crock pot until the cheese melts. While this is cooking, brown meats. Drain grease off of meats and add spices, then add to crock pot and stir.",
